Package: ubs-comm-lib
Architecture: arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libboundscheck
Description: HCOM - High-performance communication library
 HCOM is a high-performance communication library for C/S architecture
 applications.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: ubs-comm-dev
Architecture: arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends: ubs-comm-lib (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends},
         libboundscheck
Description: HCOM development files
 This package contains the development files (headers, static library)
 for HCOM library.
 .
 Install this package if you wish to develop applications that use
 HCOM library.